OL,3,GNEWSAProlific thief given tag that goes
OL,4,Aoff if he goes near shops
OL,5,
OL,6,FA prolific shoplifter will become the
OL,7,Ffirst in the region to be fitted with
OL,8,Fan ankle tag that raises an alarm if he
OL,9,Fgoes near shops he is banned from.
OL,11,FCallan Bennett, 38, from Liverpool,
OL,12,Fwill be fitted with the device after
OL,13,Fbeing convicted of 27 counts of
OL,14,Fshoplifting, Merseyside Police said.
OL,16,FHe was jailed for 18 weeks earlier this
OL,17,Fmonth, and given a criminal behaviour
OL,18,Forder (CBO) that includes wearing the
OL,19,Ftag.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
