OL,3,GNEWSAProlific thief given tag that goes
OL,4,Aoff if he goes near shops
OL,5,
OL,6,FCh Supt Natalie Perischine said the
OL,7,Felectronic device "allows police to
OL,8,Fidentify potential non-compliance, with
OL,9,Fexclusion zone breach alerts, at an
OL,10,Fearlier stage than would otherwise have
OL,11,Fbeen possible".
